              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='49009' id='9' type-v2='text' w='92615' x='1231' y='50000'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Artifakt Element Medium' fontsize='12'>Data centre water needs</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Artifakt Element Medium' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Artifakt Element Medium' fontsize='12'>vs </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Artifakt Element Medium' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Artifakt Element Medium' fontsize='12'>Domestic water needs</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Artifakt Element Medium' fontsize='10'>&quot;Impending water crisis if far closer to reality than ever before&quot;</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Artifakt Element Medium' italic='true'>This is a comparison  between data centers from data based on Mircosoft Global , Chennai Data centers and average water usage by average Chennai household.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Artifakt Element Medium'>Based on WRI AQUEDUCT water risk atlas Chennai is ranked in extremely high (4-5) for water risk. Which means more water is withdrawn compared to available resources.</run>
                  <run fontname='Artifakt Element Medium'>Æ </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#e15759' fontname='Artifakt Element Medium'>Risk of drought is high. </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Artifakt Element Medium'>In one year, Microsoft&apos;s global data centers consume enough water to sustain nearly 40,000 families in Chennai.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
